+//ä¿å­˜é¦–é”™å’Œæœ€ç»ˆç¡¬ä»¶çŠ¶æ€ï¼Œå†å‘å¸ƒå‘½ä»¤ç»ˆç»“
+static void CameraService_FinishHardware(SysResult_t result, AppV3HardwareState_t state)
