+//å…ˆæ¨è¿›æ—§æäº¤ï¼Œå†äº¤ç»™å¸§å½’è¿˜å’Œæ¶ˆè´¹ç¡®è®¤ï¼›è¿™é‡Œä¸å…è®¸è°ƒç”¨USB_Device_Stopã€‚
+static SysResult_t UsbService_AdvanceReader(bool closing)
+{
+    bool retired;
+    UsbUvcStreamStatus_t stream;
+    SysResult_t result;
+
+    if (s_uvc_reader_id == 0U)
