+//ä»…ACTIVEå…è®¸å¥åº·æŒ‚èµ·ï¼›STARTä»é¡»è§‚å¯Ÿåˆ°çœŸå®CONFIGURED
+static SysResult_t UsbService_ObserveDevice(bool *suspended)
