+//ä¸€æ¬¡å¯è¯»å›è°ƒåªæ¥æ”¶ä¸€æ¡å‘½ä»¤ï¼ŒEvent Loopè´Ÿè´£æ§åˆ¶æ‰¹æ¬¡é¢„ç®—
+static SysResult_t UsbService_Readable(AppV3Queue_t queue, void *argument)
+{
+    UsbServiceContext_t *context = &s_usb;
+    AppV3ServiceCommand_t command = {0};
+    SysResult_t result;
