+//æäº¤å•ç»„ä»¶æŸ¥è¯¢æˆ–æ¢å¤å¹¶æ²¿ç”¨æ—¢æœ‰åè°ƒçº¦æŸ
+static SysResult_t Supervisor_Single(uint32_t component, SupervisorOperation_t operation)
+{
+    uint32_t i;
+    SysResult_t result;
+
+    if (!App_MessagesIsOwner(RUNTIME_TARGET_CONTROL))
