+//å¤åˆ¶ç›‘ç£å™¨å½“å‰åªè¯»çŠ¶æ€ï¼Œä¾›åè°ƒè°ƒç”¨è€…æŸ¥è¯¢
+SysResult_t AppV3Supervisor_Read(AppV3SupervisorStatus_t *status)
+{
+    if (status == NULL)
+        return SYS_ERR_INVALID_ARG;
